<title>CANADA: Dundee Bancorp sets C$40 mln offering.</title>
<headline>Dundee Bancorp sets C$40 mln offering.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dundee Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday it has an agreement to sell an underwriting group two million subordinate voting shares at C$20 each for gross proceeds of C$40 million.</p>
<p>There is also an option for the sale of an additional 500,000 shares at the same terms.</p>
<p>Closing is expected by October 23. The shares will not be registered in the United States.</p>
<p>--Reuters Toronto bureau 416-941-8100</p>
</text>
